{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T06:06:44.892336+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 520, "candidates_tokens": 126, "total_tokens": 2563, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T06:06:44.892801+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist", "proposal_text": "It's a significant advantage to have a strong in-house team. We find that even top-tier funds experience such high deal flow that it can stretch analyst bandwidth.\n\nDoes your team ever face a situation where they must pass on analyzing potentially promising, yet time-consuming, opportunities to maintain focus on their primary pipeline?\n\nWe provide supplemental research designed to act as a flexible overflow resource for your analysts. This allows your fund to expand its coverage and vet more deals without distracting your core team from its highest priorities.\n\nI'd be happy to schedule a brief call to discuss how this could apply to your workflow."}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T06:07:03.022632+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 529, "candidates_tokens": 170, "total_tokens": 2298, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T06:07:03.023146+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "2", "role": "SME", "proposal_text": "We respect that and find that our most successful partners also have a strong in-house team. A capable internal unit is the best foundation for scaled deal sourcing.\n\nWith that in mind, does your team ever find that high deal flow forces a difficult triage process? For instance, passing on potentially valuable but time-consuming early-stage diligence to ensure your senior analysts can focus on more mature opportunities.\n\nOur service provides supplemental research capacity for exactly these scenarios. We use a structured 6-Pillar DD Framework to provide in-depth, standardized analysis on overflow targets, expanding your team's bandwidth without disrupting their core focus. This allows you to cover more ground and potentially capture alpha that might otherwise be missed due to analyst workload constraints.\n\nIf you're interested, I can elaborate on the technical and tokenomic pillars of our framework."}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T06:07:21.227028+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 522, "candidates_tokens": 108, "total_tokens": 2314, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T06:07:21.227595+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy", "proposal_text": "Thank you for the context. A strong in-house team is a critical asset for maintaining a high bar for diligence.\n\nWith a team of that caliber, you likely have excellent deal flow. My question is, does the sheer volume ever stretch your analyst bandwidth, forcing you to pass on potentially interesting but time-consuming early-stage deals?\n\nWe provide on-demand, supplemental research for funds facing this exact challenge. Our service augments your team's capacity, allowing you to cover more ground without distracting from your core pipeline."}
