{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T06:09:14.061037+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist", "proposal_text": "These are excellent questions, and they get to the core of execution rigor. Our methodology is designed precisely to provide reliable, scalable support.\n\n1.  **Metrics**: We use a peer-review scorecard for qualitative scoring. Quantitatively, we track our \"pass\" recommendations against market outcomes at 18+ months. Our historical false-positive rate on triage (passing on what becomes an eventual success) is a key internal metric we continuously audit.\n\n2.  **Data Pipeline**: We combine on-chain data with GitHub metadata analysis. For developer velocity, we track commit frequency, code churn, and contributor distribution. To validate signals, we use a time-weighted model to prioritize recent, consistent activity over historical bursts.\n\n3.  **Transparency**: Our 6 Pillars are transparent templates, but our proprietary value is the synthesis and weighting model. We can walk you through a redacted analysis on a call to demonstrate the methodology in practice.\n\nHow does your team currently account for signal decay?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T06:09:34.596420+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 969, "candidates_tokens": 208, "total_tokens": 2834, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T06:09:34.597009+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "2", "role": "SME", "proposal_text": "These are excellent questions, and they get to the core of execution rigor. Our methodology is designed precisely to provide reliable, scalable support.\n\n1.  **Metrics**: Analyst quality is measured against a standardized rubric for our 6-Pillar Framework and benchmarked internally for consistency. We track our triage efficacy by correlating initial ratings with 18-month outcomes (e.g., follow-on funding, user growth) to continuously refine our predictive models.\n\n2.  **Data Pipeline**: We ingest on-chain data and GitHub API data, focusing on commit quality and contributor diversity, not just raw volume. To validate signal integrity, we correlate historical commit velocity with subsequent product milestones to identify and account for signal decay.\n\n3.  **Framework/Sample**: The framework\u2019s structure is transparent, but our value is in the proprietary weighting and scoring models within each pillar. We can walk you through a redacted analysis on a call to demonstrate the methodology in practice.\n\nHow does your team currently account for signal decay?"}
